,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157572111,"data":"Unsloth: FlashInfer requires JIT compilation but libcuda.so (the CUDA driver stub that -lcuda needs) is not found.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157578282,"data":"  vLLM will use FLASH_ATTN attention + PyTorch sampler instead (works fine).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.15758627,"data":"  To enable FlashInfer, install the missing tools:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157589217,"data":"    nvcc  - install the CUDA toolkit or set CUDA_HOME to your CUDA installation\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157603368,"data":"    ninja - pip install ninja\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157606311,"data":"    libcuda.so - this image has the CUDA runtime but not the driver stub.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157609017,"data":"      Install cuda-compat / the CUDA toolkit's stubs, or point LIBRARY_PATH\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157611673,"data":"      at a directory containing libcuda.so (a symlink to libcuda.so.1 or to\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157614426,"data":"      /usr/local/cuda/compat/libcuda.so is enough).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157617068,"data":"  Installing the missing tools and calling again in the same session is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157619787,"data":"  enough: this probe re-runs on every load_vllm call.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":240.157622446,"data":"  To silence this warning: set UNSLOTH_VLLM_NO_FLASHINFER=1\n"}
